  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Oxfam and its partner, Disaster Emergency Committee (DEC), will work jointly to reach target households in order to increase levels of food production, income and capacity to cope with shocks. The approach will strengthen community organizations, enhance their ability to access services, negotiate with local authorities, contribute to policy development, and implement smallholder agriculture.</narrative>
